    "title": "TotalAV Mobile Security",
    "description": "Get TotalAV; your on-the-go solution for mobile security! An all in one solution combining antivirus, dangerous website protection, VPN for enhanced privacy and a host of robust cybersecurity tools.\r\n\r\nSecurity:\r\n\r\n\u2714 Scan your device for viruses and malware in Real-Time\r\n\r\n\u2714 Stay protected against phishing and scam websites\r\n\r\n\u2714 Check if your wifi connections are secure\r\n\r\n\u2714 Stay safe against bad websites hidden behind QR codes\r\n\r\nPrivacy:\r\n\r\n\u2714 Keep your information secure online with VPN encryption\r\n\r\n\u2714 See if your private data has ever been exposed online in a data breach\r\n\r\n\u2714 Lock down private apps with a PIN or biometrics\r\n\r\nAs well as security and privacy, TotalAV comes equipped with photo, video and contact management to locate duplicates, old screenshots and unwanted bursts so you can free up space on your device.\r\n\r\nSubscription fees apply details below;\r\n\r\nA monthly subscription is required to activate the 7-day trial (see in-app product pricing).\r\nCancel the subscription from your Google Play account before the end of the trial to avoid payment.\r\nAfter the 7-day trial, your subscription will start and automatically renew monthly unless canceled.\r\nYou can manage your subscriptions and adjust automatic renewal in your Google Play settings after purchase.\r\nThe 7-day trial is valid for one subscription only.\r\n\r\nNote: TotalAV Mobile Security uses the Accessibility permission to collect data about websites visited to provide website blocking and app locking functions.\r\n\r\nTotalAV respects your online privacy and is dedicated to safeguarding your personal data. See https://www.totalav.com/privacy for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get TotalAV; your on-the-go solution for mobile security! An all in one solution combining antivirus, dangerous website protection, VPN for enhanced privacy and a host of robust cybersecurity tools.<br><br>Security:<br><br>\u2714 Scan your device for viruses and malware in Real-Time<br><br>\u2714 Stay protected against phishing and scam websites<br><br>\u2714 Check if your wifi connections are secure<br><br>\u2714 Stay safe against bad websites hidden behind QR codes<br><br>Privacy:<br><br>\u2714 Keep your information secure online with VPN encryption<br><br>\u2714 See if your private data has ever been exposed online in a data breach<br><br>\u2714 Lock down private apps with a PIN or biometrics<br><br>As well as security and privacy, TotalAV comes equipped with photo, video and contact management to locate duplicates, old screenshots and unwanted bursts so you can free up space on your device.<br><br>Subscription fees apply details below;<br><br>A monthly subscription is required to activate the 7-day trial (see in-app product pricing).<br>Cancel the subscription from your Google Play account before the end of the trial to avoid payment.<br>After the 7-day trial, your subscription will start and automatically renew monthly unless canceled.<br>You can manage your subscriptions and adjust automatic renewal in your Google Play settings after purchase.<br>The 7-day trial is valid for one subscription only.<br><br>Note: TotalAV Mobile Security uses the Accessibility permission to collect data about websites visited to provide website blocking and app locking functions.<br><br>TotalAV respects your online privacy and is dedicated to safeguarding your personal data. See https://www.totalav.com/privacy for more information.",
